  "body": "LR2021 supports FLRC (Fast Long Range Communication) mode with data rates up to 2600 kbps, but no example sketches exist for it.\n\nThis adds two examples following the existing pattern of `LR2021_Transmit_Blocking` and `LR2021_Receive_Blocking`:\n\n- `LR2021_FLRC_Transmit` — basic FLRC packet transmission with error handling\n- `LR2021_FLRC_Receive` — basic FLRC packet reception with RSSI display\n\nBoth sketches use the same pin definitions, TCXO configuration, and code style as the existing LoRa/GFSK examples.",
